      },
      "eli:language": "en",
      "eli:number": "DR-51-2001",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_5"
      ],
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Seri Pahlawan Gagah Perkasa (Remembrance Allowance) (Amendment) Bill 2001"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Seri Pahlawan Gagah Perkasa (Remembrance Allowance) (Amendment) Act 2001. Amendment of section 3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Seri Pahlawan Gagah Perkasa (Remembrance Allowance) Act 1990 [Act 439], which is referred to as the \"principal Act\" in this Act, is amended in subsection 3(1) by substituting for the words \"two hundred\" the words \"four hundred\" wherever it appears. Amendment of section 4"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 4 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: \"(1A) For the purposes of subsection (1), the month in which the sentence is imposed means the month in which such sentence is pronounced by the trial court or if there is an appeal against such sentence the month in which such sentence is confirmed on such appeal.\". Computation and manner of payment"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the avoidance of doubt, any payment made under section 3 of the principal Act before the commencement of this Act shall be reckoned as part of the payment payable under section 3 of the principal Act as amended in this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The difference between the amount payable under section 3 of the principal Act as amended in this Act and the amount payable under section 3 of the principal Act before the commencement of this Act shall, upon the commencement of this Act—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "become an amount due to a recipient; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "be made payable in any manner as may be determined by the Prime Minister. Grant to next-of-kin of recipient who had died before commencement of Act"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_5__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_5__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_5__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "( 1) Where a recipient had died before the commencement of this Act, the remembrance allowance due to him under subsection 3(2) of this Act, if any, which ceases in the month in which the death of the recipient takes place, shall be paid—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_5__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to the spouse or spouses and children of the deceased recipient who is or are living on the date of the commencement of this Act;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_5__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "if on the date of the commencement of this Act no spouse or child of the deceased recipient is living, to the parents or parent of the deceased recipient who are or is living on such date; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_5__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "if on the date of the commencement of this Act no spouse, child or parent of the deceased recipient is living, to the grandparents or grandparent of the deceased recipient who are or is living on such date."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The amount to be paid to the spouse or spouses, children, parents or grandparents, as the case may be, under subsection (1) shall be in such proportions as may be determined by the Prime Minister. (Remembrance Allowance) (Amendment)"
      }
    }
  ]
}
